WEBVTT

01:48.080 --> 01:50.200
The Shu Road is difficult,

01:50.280 --> 01:52.960
more difficult
than ascending to the heavens.

01:58.280 --> 01:59.160
Miss Ji.

02:01.040 --> 02:02.080
Are you a ghost?

02:02.160 --> 02:04.040
Why are you running here
so early in the morning?

02:04.120 --> 02:05.280
What ghost?

02:06.160 --> 02:07.240
You're injured.

02:08.160 --> 02:09.199
I…

02:09.800 --> 02:11.280
I'll go get Zhuge to help you.

02:12.760 --> 02:13.840
Can I talk to you for a moment?

02:15.400 --> 02:17.080
Your wound needs to be treated quickly.

02:17.160 --> 02:18.000
I can't stand the sight of blood.

02:21.960 --> 02:22.920
You're afraid I'll drag you down?

02:30.320 --> 02:31.560
Sorry for the trouble.

02:34.400 --> 02:35.480
Wait a minute.

02:41.240 --> 02:43.080
I hope you didn't get
into too much trouble.

02:43.160 --> 02:45.000
Otherwise, I'll throw you into the river.

02:48.560 --> 02:49.640
Wait.

03:16.000 --> 03:19.480
THE SHU ROAD IS DIFFICULT

03:26.680 --> 03:27.680
This is Li Bai?

03:30.760 --> 03:32.640
When you asked me about
the names of people from Shu,

03:32.720 --> 03:34.160
I knew you'd use them for this.

03:35.560 --> 03:37.480
Thank you for your guidance.

03:37.560 --> 03:40.360
I'm planning to partner with the merchants
to sell brocade clothes.

03:41.160 --> 03:42.520
You're entering the brocade business?

03:43.560 --> 03:45.160
You certainly have lofty ambitions.

03:45.760 --> 03:47.640
Our family used to be
in the brocade weaving business.

03:51.720 --> 03:52.720
Come sit over here.

04:03.760 --> 04:05.840
Are you planning
to treat me through the curtain?

04:07.040 --> 04:07.960
I'm not a doctor.

04:08.040 --> 04:09.680
If you want to save a life,
you wouldn't come to me.

04:11.400 --> 04:12.240
Clean the wound.

04:39.640 --> 04:41.320
You seem pretty upset.

04:42.440 --> 04:44.400
Is it because you lost the fight?

04:46.920 --> 04:48.360
Do I look like someone
who can't accept losing?

04:49.280 --> 04:50.840
That depends on what you lost.

04:53.400 --> 04:55.240
What do you think shouldn't be lost?

04:55.840 --> 04:58.920
For me, it's family and belief.

05:02.160 --> 05:03.840
I remember when I first
entered the society,

05:04.920 --> 05:07.200
love was love, and hatred was hatred.

05:08.560 --> 05:10.600
Anyone who dares to commit
an evil deed in front of me

05:11.160 --> 05:12.840
must first ask my sword.

05:14.920 --> 05:17.520
But now, as an official,
everything is different.

05:18.480 --> 05:20.720
It seems there's no
black and white anymore

05:22.400 --> 05:23.560
and no good and evil.

05:25.960 --> 05:28.560
If you want to pull
the evil spirits out of hell,

05:29.240 --> 05:32.000
you must first roll through hell yourself.

05:34.600 --> 05:35.960
I've grown to hate this so much.

05:37.160 --> 05:38.080
My master,

05:38.840 --> 05:40.680
such a clean and tidy old man,

05:42.360 --> 05:44.080
how did he endure it?

05:51.440 --> 05:54.480
It seems you don't want to talk with me.

05:55.520 --> 05:59.360
You always speak in riddles,
advancing step by step.

06:00.040 --> 06:01.080
I don't understand.

06:02.160 --> 06:04.200
So, I don't know how
to have a conversation.

06:06.200 --> 06:07.240
You want to understand?

06:08.840 --> 06:10.040
But if you understand,

06:10.880 --> 06:12.120
you won't be able to leave this boat.

06:14.080 --> 06:15.720
I must know the answer first,

06:15.800 --> 06:18.880
then I'll consider
whether I should board your boat.

06:32.960 --> 06:34.000
Then take a look at this.

06:44.360 --> 06:45.560
Where did you get this from?

06:46.240 --> 06:48.720
I found it. Is there a problem?

06:50.280 --> 06:51.320
I don't know.

06:55.840 --> 06:57.760
The former brocade officer,
Shen Rufeng, was my master.

06:59.560 --> 07:01.160
I don't believe he died of illness.

07:01.720 --> 07:05.320
I came back to Yizhou this time
to investigate his death.

07:05.920 --> 07:06.840
I found this silk

07:07.400 --> 07:09.520
when I was investigating his corpse.

07:13.640 --> 07:14.640
This silk

07:15.480 --> 07:17.480
is made using my father's
Shu Red Silk formula.

07:19.000 --> 07:20.760
But dyeing silk is different
from weaving brocade.

07:21.440 --> 07:23.680
The weather, temperature, and humidity

07:23.760 --> 07:26.520
can change the silk color in an instant.

07:26.600 --> 07:29.520
You must stand by the dye vat
and adjust accordingly.

07:29.600 --> 07:32.360
So, even with the secret formula,

07:32.440 --> 07:34.520
it's not guaranteed
to dye true Shu Red Silk.

07:36.360 --> 07:37.520
You mean this silk is fake?

07:41.040 --> 07:43.920
To brighten and set the color,
it's been treated with sulfur smoke.

07:45.200 --> 07:48.840
It's miles away from true Shu Red Silk.

07:51.160 --> 07:52.560
After my father passed,

07:52.640 --> 07:55.360
there have occasionally been
fake Shu Red Silk products on the market.

07:56.280 --> 07:57.880
I've seen it a few times.

07:57.960 --> 08:00.440
This one is the closest to the real thing.

08:03.720 --> 08:05.280
Last time you mentioned

08:05.360 --> 08:07.320
the court urgently needing Shu Red Silk
to make clothing for the Empress.

08:07.400 --> 08:09.040
You didn't rush in desperation

08:09.120 --> 08:11.560
and treat this silk as Shu Red Silk,
then send it off to Chang'an, did you?

08:14.000 --> 08:16.880
Do you remember
why your father was sentenced?

08:20.600 --> 08:21.680
What exactly are you trying to say?

08:23.640 --> 08:25.240
Before my master died,

08:25.320 --> 08:27.720
he was investigating Shu Red Silk
and the case concerning your father.

08:29.240 --> 08:30.640
Have you considered

08:31.400 --> 08:32.440
that what we seek

08:33.640 --> 08:35.840
could very well be the same truth?

08:42.960 --> 08:46.680
So, this is why you
have come to find me today.

08:47.600 --> 08:48.960
I didn't plan to say this before,

08:49.800 --> 08:52.240
but somehow, while talking,

08:52.920 --> 08:54.200
I've ended up telling you everything.

08:55.960 --> 08:57.080
You don't believe me?

08:58.960 --> 09:00.000
Well, the future is long.

09:00.520 --> 09:01.920
One day, I'll make you believe.

09:02.800 --> 09:04.240
But for now,

09:04.320 --> 09:06.080
I still need your help

09:06.880 --> 09:08.920
to tie this bandage.

09:15.440 --> 09:17.800
Hot water is free,
but the wound medicine costs five qian.

09:18.560 --> 09:20.480
I don't have any money.
But I can give you one life.

09:20.560 --> 09:21.520
Come on.

09:32.040 --> 09:33.480
Please tie it gently.

09:39.840 --> 09:41.480
You have quite a strong grip.

09:54.480 --> 09:59.880
HEARTLESS MANOR

09:59.960 --> 10:01.160
Sir,

10:01.240 --> 10:03.040
this must be the work of a schemer,

10:03.120 --> 10:05.440
seeing your happy union
and feeling jealous.

10:05.520 --> 10:07.680
Don't mind it. I'll throw it away.

10:07.760 --> 10:08.680
No need.

10:14.360 --> 10:15.680
Heartless…

10:19.200 --> 10:20.400
I suspect that in the future,

10:21.240 --> 10:24.000
everyone in Yizhou will see me like this.

10:25.440 --> 10:26.480
I don't care.

10:29.280 --> 10:30.520
Grandfather has power.

10:31.720 --> 10:33.800
He can make everyone in the house

10:33.880 --> 10:35.800
live according to his rules.

10:37.360 --> 10:38.800
Niu Wuniang has power.

10:39.960 --> 10:42.880
She can decide
a person's life or death at will.

10:42.960 --> 10:44.600
Mr. Yang has power too.

10:46.000 --> 10:47.160
He can live his life freely

10:47.240 --> 10:49.760
according to his own preferences.

10:53.640 --> 10:55.000
When I have power,

10:56.520 --> 10:58.920
I'll make sure to protect

11:00.440 --> 11:02.320
the ones I want to protect.

11:09.360 --> 11:10.840
BROCADE BUREAU

11:13.880 --> 11:15.440
This silk cannot be
presented to the court.

11:15.520 --> 11:17.880
Now that you've delivered
this fake silk to Chang'an,

11:17.960 --> 11:19.360
you must acknowledge it as genuine.

11:20.680 --> 11:23.240
Niu Wuniang wants to tie you together

11:23.320 --> 11:25.320
with this fake Shu Red Silk.

11:26.480 --> 11:27.600
If I don't deliver,

11:28.360 --> 11:29.840
how could she let us off the hook?

11:47.440 --> 11:48.480
In the heart of Mount Qingcheng,

11:48.560 --> 11:51.000
there's a place called San Pool.
Have you heard of it?

11:51.080 --> 11:52.000
I've heard of it.

11:56.160 --> 11:57.880
Send someone to search near there,

11:57.960 --> 12:01.040
especially around places
with blue wildflowers.

12:03.760 --> 12:06.200
- Where did you go before?
- Mount Qingcheng.

12:07.040 --> 12:08.640
That's it. Look here.

12:08.720 --> 12:11.640
This kind of blue is mostly
extracted from mineral dyes

12:11.720 --> 12:13.200
and rarely appears in herbs.

12:13.800 --> 12:17.280
The only wildflower
I've seen with this color

12:17.360 --> 12:18.760
grows by the edge of San Pool.

12:20.040 --> 12:21.760
- Understood.
- Off you go.

12:23.560 --> 12:24.840
What about the matters in Chang'an?

12:29.640 --> 12:31.920
Mr. Yang, you're betting your life!

12:33.040 --> 12:33.920
Are you afraid I'll die?

12:38.320 --> 12:39.440
Then, when that time comes,

12:39.520 --> 12:41.200
you can replace me

12:41.280 --> 12:43.080
with a more obedient and reliable ally.

12:43.160 --> 12:44.760
Wouldn't that be even better?

12:48.200 --> 12:49.400
Niu Jin will return to the city soon.

12:50.160 --> 12:52.120
He might be even harder
to deal with than Niu Wuniang.

13:20.040 --> 13:22.400
NIU JIN
DEPUTY GENERAL OF JIAN'NAN STREET

13:28.880 --> 13:30.560
PEACE AND PROSPERITY

13:30.640 --> 13:32.320
Welcome General Niu back to the city!

13:36.960 --> 13:38.280
Governor Zhang, you're too kind.

13:38.800 --> 13:39.640
GOVERNOR ZHANG

13:39.720 --> 13:43.240
Your efforts have greatly benefited
the people of Jian'nan.

13:43.320 --> 13:44.160
Such hard work!

13:45.760 --> 13:47.360
It's been a year,

13:47.440 --> 13:50.360
and you're still as impressive as ever!

13:50.440 --> 13:51.280
MR. MENG

13:51.360 --> 13:52.320
General Niu,

13:52.400 --> 13:54.200
after such a long journey,

13:54.280 --> 13:56.960
I've prepared a welcome feast for you.

13:57.040 --> 13:58.440
I hope you'll grace us with your presence.

14:00.400 --> 14:01.840
You're the new Brocade Officer?

14:04.240 --> 14:06.560
I am Yang Jinglan. Pleased to meet you.

14:09.440 --> 14:11.320
Your elder brother has been renowned
as the Brocade Master

14:11.400 --> 14:12.360
for several terms.

14:12.440 --> 14:15.600
I never expected you
would make such a mark as well,

14:15.680 --> 14:17.480
becoming the Brocade Officer of Yizhou.

14:18.240 --> 14:20.040
You flatter me, General Niu.

14:20.120 --> 14:22.040
This is my first time in office.

14:23.200 --> 14:24.920
I welcome any advice you have.

14:39.960 --> 14:43.720
Though Deputy General Niu
is not a virtuous person,

14:43.800 --> 14:47.400
this Yizhou city
is the military commissioner's Yizhou.

14:48.200 --> 14:49.600
Governor Zhang

14:49.680 --> 14:52.520
is the military commissioner's eyes
in the city.

14:53.120 --> 14:55.040
As long as Zhang's here,

14:55.120 --> 14:59.600
Deputy General Niu
won't dare to act openly.

14:59.680 --> 15:00.960
The whole city came to greet him,

15:01.040 --> 15:02.800
but he didn't even dismount his horse.

15:04.000 --> 15:05.840
Niu Jin holds the military power.

15:05.920 --> 15:07.320
He's had countless military achievements.

15:07.920 --> 15:10.960
He's the top general
under the military commissioner.

15:11.040 --> 15:13.360
Naturally, he doesn't care about anyone.

15:14.400 --> 15:17.040
But he's just a Deputy General.

15:17.920 --> 15:19.920
No matter how arrogant he is,

15:20.000 --> 15:22.560
he still has to respect a few things.

15:23.520 --> 15:26.160
People say you're indifferent to others,

15:26.240 --> 15:27.640
but I don't think so.

15:29.680 --> 15:32.720
Human kindness must be shown
to those who have humanity.

15:32.800 --> 15:34.360
If they have no humanity,

15:35.200 --> 15:36.360
why should I care for them?

15:38.080 --> 15:39.840
Thank you for your compliment.

15:41.320 --> 15:42.760
Did you ask me to meet here today

15:42.840 --> 15:44.480
because the clothes are ready?

15:45.040 --> 15:47.160
The clothes are in the shop
across the street.

15:47.240 --> 15:49.640
Later, please take a look.

15:52.000 --> 15:55.640
Miss Ji, your good ideas
are sure to be accepted

15:55.720 --> 15:58.080
by anyone you partner with.

15:58.960 --> 16:01.920
So, why approach me?

16:03.840 --> 16:05.400
Bloom Society has just been established.

16:05.480 --> 16:07.400
It's famous but lacks depth.

16:07.480 --> 16:10.280
Allying with the top brocade merchants
is the best choice.

16:10.880 --> 16:13.640
You are upright, kind, and generous,

16:13.720 --> 16:14.880
so you're naturally my first choice.

16:35.120 --> 16:37.800
If you were a man,

16:37.880 --> 16:40.960
you would surely accomplish great things.

16:41.840 --> 16:43.240
For centuries to come,

16:43.320 --> 16:44.760
there have been many successful women.

16:46.440 --> 16:49.040
There's Ba Qing, Zhuo Wenjun,

16:49.120 --> 16:50.320
Empress Wu,

16:51.000 --> 16:51.840
and even Nuwa.

16:52.840 --> 16:53.960
Humankind was created by Nuwa.

16:54.040 --> 16:56.280
Meaning a woman created this world.

16:58.680 --> 17:00.440
My view was too narrow.

17:01.880 --> 17:06.359
NIU RESIDENCE

17:08.079 --> 17:09.280
Father, please have some tea.

17:13.280 --> 17:15.240
You have such courage.

17:16.280 --> 17:19.079
You dare to make decisions
about your own marriage!

17:25.119 --> 17:26.640
This has nothing to do with you.
Leave now.

17:26.720 --> 17:27.760
Yes.

17:35.000 --> 17:36.160
Father,

17:36.240 --> 17:38.800
I am not in love with Zhao Xiuyuan,

17:38.880 --> 17:39.920
but I am considering you.

17:41.360 --> 17:42.960
You're aiming for the brocade business.

17:43.040 --> 17:45.360
Rather than marrying me off
to a distant relative,

17:45.880 --> 17:48.920
why not promise me
to a future Brocade Master?

17:50.600 --> 17:52.640
A future Brocade Master?

17:52.720 --> 17:54.720
The Zhao family is just a merchant family.

17:54.800 --> 17:56.760
How can they compare to the military
commissioner's distant relatives?

17:58.240 --> 18:00.280
Father, you are the military
commissioner's trusted confidant,

18:00.360 --> 18:02.520
with your troops
stationed outside Yizhou City.

18:03.520 --> 18:05.760
Alliances with distant relatives
will bring us no benefit.

18:06.960 --> 18:08.120
In Yizhou's brocade business,

18:08.200 --> 18:10.640
the Yang family has held the title
of Brocade Master for five years.

18:12.040 --> 18:13.720
We've only been able
to weave brocade in the mountains.

18:14.920 --> 18:16.520
If I marry into the Zhao family,

18:17.120 --> 18:20.120
let them replace the Yang family
and become the new Brocade Master,

18:20.840 --> 18:22.040
taking over the court orders,

18:22.120 --> 18:24.680
wouldn't it be a legitimate way
to change the situation?

18:27.640 --> 18:29.240
Have you told this to the Zhao family?

18:35.960 --> 18:38.240
Once I marry into the Zhao family,
we'll become one family.

18:38.920 --> 18:40.760
Their success will be our success,
their downfall our downfall.

18:40.840 --> 18:43.560
I think they'll understand this logic.

18:49.120 --> 18:50.520
This logic,

18:50.600 --> 18:53.240
I'm afraid even you
haven't fully understood yet.

18:56.320 --> 18:59.160
I'm not only thinking
about my own marriage.

18:59.240 --> 19:00.920
I have already found
a weakness in Yang Jinglan.

19:01.480 --> 19:02.760
Whether to kill,
investigate, or spare him,

19:03.440 --> 19:04.400
it's up to you.

19:05.720 --> 19:07.800
I've heard that Yang Jinglan
found the brocade workshop.

19:08.600 --> 19:11.400
The trap to lure him in was fake,

19:11.480 --> 19:14.040
but our real brocade workshop
is still at the original location,

19:14.120 --> 19:14.960
heavily guarded.

19:15.040 --> 19:16.240
Please rest assured.

19:20.040 --> 19:22.000
Three brocade officers
have died in succession.

19:23.080 --> 19:24.600
The court didn't investigate before

19:24.680 --> 19:26.400
because it had more pressing concerns.

19:27.480 --> 19:30.720
Now that the Crown Prince has eased
the rift between the factions,

19:30.800 --> 19:34.320
the court won't turn
a blind eye like before.

19:35.200 --> 19:37.000
Shu brocade is priceless.

19:37.080 --> 19:38.960
The court will never ignore it.

19:39.840 --> 19:41.400
Once this batch of brocade is completed,

19:41.480 --> 19:43.000
immediately deal with the brocade workshop

19:43.080 --> 19:45.040
to avoid future complications.

19:46.000 --> 19:47.720
As for that brocade officer,

19:48.360 --> 19:49.480
don't act against him for now.

19:50.840 --> 19:51.840
I understand, Father.

20:00.680 --> 20:03.560
Greetings, my father-in-law.

20:04.160 --> 20:05.280
What brings you here?

20:06.760 --> 20:08.800
Lady Wuniang sent someone
to inform me that you've returned,

20:09.440 --> 20:10.640
so I came to pay my respects.

20:12.840 --> 20:14.600
If she hadn't said anything,
you wouldn't have come, would you?

20:18.320 --> 20:20.320
As a lowly son-in-law,

20:20.400 --> 20:23.240
I feared that coming on my own
might offend you.

20:25.520 --> 20:27.160
Why did you call him here?

20:28.640 --> 20:31.200
There's something I'd like you to look at.

20:32.320 --> 20:36.120
I also called Mr. Zhao here
so he can see my dowry.

20:50.280 --> 20:51.520
Shu Red Silk!

21:05.160 --> 21:09.240
Just now, you were calm and composed
in front of my father,

21:09.320 --> 21:10.600
acting appropriately.

21:11.400 --> 21:13.680
It seems you've thought things through.

21:15.040 --> 21:17.040
I was just fulfilling my duties

21:17.120 --> 21:18.440
as a husband and son-in-law.

21:21.200 --> 21:23.000
You're adapting so quickly.

21:23.680 --> 21:25.760
It makes me a little worried.

21:30.680 --> 21:32.480
Since the marriage is already a fact,

21:32.560 --> 21:34.200
even if I'm unhappy,

21:34.280 --> 21:36.760
I'll still fulfill my responsibilities
as a husband.

21:37.320 --> 21:38.320
As for you,

21:38.960 --> 21:40.760
I don't expect you to honor
your parents-in-law

21:40.840 --> 21:41.880
or get along with your sisters-in-law.

21:42.520 --> 21:43.920
But I do hope you understand

21:44.000 --> 21:45.880
the basic manners of a daughter-in-law.

22:14.760 --> 22:17.040
Dear neighbors and folks,

22:17.120 --> 22:18.840
the poet Du Fu once said,

22:19.440 --> 22:21.680
"Dawn sees saturated reds

22:21.760 --> 22:23.800
The town's heavy with blooms"

22:23.880 --> 22:26.720
This speaks to the brilliance
of Shu brocade.

22:27.840 --> 22:28.680
Not long ago,

22:28.760 --> 22:31.480
our Bloom Society borrowed the poetry

22:31.560 --> 22:35.720
of Poet Qinglian and Xue Tao
to inspire creativity.

22:35.800 --> 22:37.480
We collaborated with the Yu family

22:37.560 --> 22:39.280
to create ten sets of gorgeous clothing.

22:39.360 --> 22:42.240
Today, we present them for your enjoyment!

22:42.320 --> 22:44.040
Bravo!

22:52.800 --> 22:53.960
Shu Red?

22:54.560 --> 22:56.680
Isn't Shu Red already gone?

22:57.640 --> 22:58.480
What's going on?

23:00.680 --> 23:02.680
My family was famous for Shu Red Silk.

23:03.440 --> 23:04.760
After my father passed away,

23:04.840 --> 23:06.880
Shu Red Silk disappeared with him.

23:07.680 --> 23:09.080
But the term "Shu Red" itself

23:09.160 --> 23:11.960
originally referred
to the red color dyed in Shu.

23:12.840 --> 23:13.680
I'm just a humble daughter

23:13.760 --> 23:16.400
and can't reproduce
my father's Shu Red Silk.

23:16.480 --> 23:19.560
But I can present to you
more examples of Shu Red!

23:19.640 --> 23:20.920
Good!

23:31.560 --> 23:33.760
This garment is called "Flowers in Bloom".

23:33.840 --> 23:36.520
It's woven from a mix of Flushed Rose,

23:36.600 --> 23:38.840
light pink, and bright pink silk.

23:38.920 --> 23:41.200
And it's adorned with a poem
from Poet Qinglian,

23:41.280 --> 23:42.800
forming its own style.

23:42.880 --> 23:45.200
We drink together
Among the mountain blooms

23:45.280 --> 23:47.840
One cup, then another, and yet another

23:47.920 --> 23:50.000
I grow drunk
Longing for rest; you may depart

23:50.080 --> 23:52.400
But bring your qin tomorrow
If you wish to drink again

23:52.480 --> 23:54.160
Bravo!

23:58.560 --> 24:00.640
This garment is named "Nine Hues of Dawn".

24:00.720 --> 24:02.720
Pale Rose is the main color,

24:02.800 --> 24:05.520
with Lilac and Tangerine as the accents.

24:06.120 --> 24:08.360
It's inspired by the poetry of Xue Tao.

24:08.440 --> 24:10.720
The nine breaths split
Into nine-colored clouds

24:10.800 --> 24:12.800
As five spirits ride
Their five-clouded chariot

24:12.880 --> 24:14.360
The spring breeze, passing through
The East Lord's domain

24:14.440 --> 24:17.480
Steals a sample and paints
The blooms with vibrant hues

24:17.560 --> 24:20.080
Bravo!

24:23.880 --> 24:24.720
Folks,

24:25.440 --> 24:28.960
next, let me present "Beauty Yu".

24:29.560 --> 24:30.760
Great!

24:51.360 --> 24:54.080
What a charming young man!

24:54.800 --> 24:56.360
- This outfit is quite beautiful.
- It's beautiful.

24:56.440 --> 24:59.160
But the flowers on the head
and the makeup on the face…

24:59.240 --> 25:00.440
Oh my!

25:11.120 --> 25:13.040
Isn't this Mr. Zhao?

25:13.120 --> 25:15.280
WEDDING PROCESSION

25:28.680 --> 25:30.920
- Yes.
- Share a bit of the joyous luck!

25:50.240 --> 25:51.280
This is the Zhao family's
wedding procession.

25:52.000 --> 25:53.920
Don't block the road! Quickly, move aside!

25:55.160 --> 25:56.960
Your Zhao family is truly impressive!

25:57.040 --> 26:00.280
So, does that mean the entire street
is owned by your family?

26:00.360 --> 26:01.680
Exactly.

26:01.760 --> 26:03.600
Do you understand the order of precedence?

26:03.680 --> 26:06.240
You don't understand?
Even a three-year-old would understand!

26:06.320 --> 26:08.200
- Exactly!
- We're here first.

26:08.280 --> 26:09.960
If you don't move,

26:10.040 --> 26:11.280
don't blame me for being rude.

26:12.080 --> 26:13.560
Don't be polite. Come on!

26:13.640 --> 26:14.480
What do you mean by "being rude"?

26:14.560 --> 26:15.680
How do you want to be rude?

26:15.760 --> 26:17.720
Don't be polite. Come on! Come on!

26:17.800 --> 26:20.200
- What do you want?
- What do you want?

26:20.280 --> 26:22.320
- What do you want?
- What do you want?

26:23.320 --> 26:24.480
What do you want?

26:24.560 --> 26:27.840
- Move aside!
- I won't move!

26:29.000 --> 26:29.920
I won't move!

26:30.000 --> 26:32.200
- Move aside!
- I said I won't move!

26:32.280 --> 26:34.000
Come, let's see who's the bigger one!

26:34.720 --> 26:36.000
- Who's the bigger one!
- Move!

26:45.440 --> 26:47.760
Today is Mr. Zhao's wedding day.

26:48.360 --> 26:49.760
We'll make way,

26:50.840 --> 26:52.080
and what harm will that do?

26:59.440 --> 27:01.080
We can make way,

27:01.160 --> 27:03.280
but this excitement cannot be given up!

27:03.360 --> 27:04.320
Exactly!

27:04.400 --> 27:05.800
Let me perform a dance for you!

27:45.440 --> 27:46.520
Grandfather promised me

27:47.120 --> 27:49.920
if I could secure the title
of Brocade Master this time,

27:50.640 --> 27:51.760
he'd allow me

27:52.800 --> 27:54.440
to propose to your family.

27:54.520 --> 27:57.000
Hasn't been launched yet,
and it's already working its magic?

27:59.880 --> 28:02.360
You came here just for me.
You're really different.

28:03.520 --> 28:05.240
Rising swiftly to the heavens.

28:05.320 --> 28:07.800
Isn't this exactly the person in my heart?

28:07.880 --> 28:10.360
He who understands me
is none other than Mr. Zhao.

28:13.160 --> 28:15.040
We've worked so hard for so long,

28:15.120 --> 28:17.640
and finally, we can be together.

28:17.720 --> 28:18.960
Don't give up…

28:24.760 --> 28:26.920
Perhaps our emotions

28:27.000 --> 28:28.720
aren't as important as you think.

28:29.720 --> 28:31.200
But abandoning you

28:31.800 --> 28:33.560
is my own choice.

28:33.640 --> 28:35.560
BRIDE NIU WUNIANG, BRIDEGROOM ZHAO XIUYUAN

28:45.000 --> 28:46.360
Walk over the mats and bags,

28:46.440 --> 28:48.880
wishing for the continuity of generations!

28:48.960 --> 28:52.320
Scatter beans to ward off
the three misfortunes!

28:53.400 --> 28:56.880
First, for wealth and prosperity!

28:58.040 --> 29:01.680
Second, for gold and jade in abundance!

29:02.280 --> 29:06.080
Third, for the three top honors
in the imperial exam!

29:06.920 --> 29:10.680
Fourth, for dragon and phoenix
bringing good fortune!

29:11.800 --> 29:15.440
Fifth, for sons becoming ministers!

29:15.520 --> 29:20.160
- Governor Zhang.
- Sixth, for thriving in harmony!

29:21.760 --> 29:23.000
How come you're here too?

29:24.120 --> 29:26.080
General Niu is here.
Who would dare not come?

29:28.480 --> 29:32.320
Look, half of Yizhou's elite has arrived.

29:34.200 --> 29:38.560
Tenth, for full blessings!

29:39.320 --> 29:42.520
The bride steps over
the saddle and the balance,

29:42.600 --> 29:44.440
wishing all her desires be fulfilled

29:44.520 --> 29:46.680
and for peace and happiness
through generations!

29:47.680 --> 29:49.880
HAPPINESS

29:54.480 --> 29:56.520
Looking into the mirror, bow in respect.

29:59.160 --> 30:03.080
Husband and wife, as one,
may all evil be driven away!

30:11.680 --> 30:15.920
Tie the belt together
and enter the bridal chamber!

30:16.720 --> 30:17.680
All right.

30:18.400 --> 30:20.160
We no longer need you here.
You may leave now.

30:25.680 --> 30:26.960
Xiuyuan, stay a moment.

30:43.440 --> 30:46.080
Congratulations, General Niu!

30:49.120 --> 30:49.960
Esteemed guests,

30:50.640 --> 30:53.440
today, aside
from my daughter's wedding joy,

30:53.520 --> 30:56.400
I have another happy event
to share with you all.

30:59.080 --> 31:00.640
Everyone, please sit.

31:08.080 --> 31:09.240
Xiuyuan,

31:09.320 --> 31:11.520
since everyone's here today,

31:11.600 --> 31:14.160
bring out your hard work
and let everyone see.

31:15.200 --> 31:16.040
Got it.

31:35.880 --> 31:37.320
That's the one!

31:37.400 --> 31:38.800
It's marvelous.

31:54.120 --> 31:57.720
Shu Red outshines all reds

31:57.800 --> 31:59.800
and outshines in six palaces
the fairest face.

32:00.800 --> 32:01.840
What a pity.

32:01.920 --> 32:05.000
Since Ji Guinan was punished and died,

32:05.080 --> 32:08.440
Shu Red has also disappeared.

32:09.040 --> 32:11.280
For many years, the Zhao family

32:11.360 --> 32:14.800
has been determined
to revive the glory of Shu Red.

32:15.600 --> 32:17.480
Heaven rewards the determined.

32:18.160 --> 32:20.320
My grandson, Zhao Xiuyuan,

32:20.400 --> 32:24.320
the future head of the Zhao family,

32:24.400 --> 32:30.280
has finally perfected
this Shu Red that outshines all reds!

32:30.360 --> 32:32.680
Isn't Mr. Zhao in the brocade business?

32:32.760 --> 32:34.280
How did he also learn silk dyeing?

32:34.360 --> 32:36.320
Is it because of Ji Yingying…?

32:41.920 --> 32:44.760
You're all veterans
of the brocade business.

32:44.840 --> 32:48.280
You've all seen
the unparalleled beauty of Shu Red.

32:49.040 --> 32:51.160
Today, I ask you to witness

32:51.880 --> 32:55.360
whether this silk
truly represents real Shu Red.

32:59.200 --> 33:01.080
Wasn't Shu Red already lost to history?

33:01.600 --> 33:02.880
How is it like the original?

33:02.960 --> 33:04.320
Over the years,

33:04.400 --> 33:06.520
many have claimed to have dyed it,

33:07.120 --> 33:08.400
but in the end,

33:10.040 --> 33:11.280
none of them are true.

33:16.160 --> 33:18.960
Call the Ji siblings to appraise the silk!

33:19.520 --> 33:21.800
YUEBUHUAN INN

33:21.880 --> 33:23.000
Hurry!

33:23.080 --> 33:25.000
Let's count today's earnings.

33:25.080 --> 33:26.560
We'll split them
with the Yu family, 60-40.

33:27.960 --> 33:29.360
60-40 split.

33:29.440 --> 33:30.600
- We've made quite a profit today!
- Yingying,

33:30.680 --> 33:31.680
- bad news!
- Yaoting.

33:31.760 --> 33:33.200
Zhao Xiuyuan

33:33.280 --> 33:34.360
has dyed Shu Red Silk!

33:45.360 --> 33:46.480
Mr. Yang,

33:47.280 --> 33:48.640
we invited you here today

33:48.720 --> 33:50.680
to publicly confirm

33:51.280 --> 33:53.880
whether this Shu Red Silk is real or fake.

34:00.760 --> 34:03.280
General Niu, this Shu Red Silk

34:03.360 --> 34:05.480
is hard to distinguish with the naked eye.

34:05.560 --> 34:07.160
But I remember

34:07.240 --> 34:10.719
the real Shu Red Silk
wouldn't fade even in alkaline water.

34:10.800 --> 34:13.400
That's a way to tell if it's real or fake.

34:13.480 --> 34:14.760
Apply alkaline water.

34:18.080 --> 34:19.320
Please, everyone, inspect the silk.

34:46.800 --> 34:50.600
Congrats to Mr. Zhao
for reviving Shu Red Silk!

34:51.440 --> 34:52.600
General Niu,

34:52.679 --> 34:56.040
since Mr. Zhao
has successfully dyed Shu Red Silk

34:56.120 --> 34:58.360
and is the future head of the Zhao family,

34:58.440 --> 34:59.640
it's certainly a cause for celebration!

34:59.720 --> 35:01.360
The future is bright for him!

35:04.960 --> 35:05.960
Mr. Yang.

35:10.080 --> 35:11.320
As for this Shu Red Silk,

35:12.920 --> 35:13.960
everyone,

35:15.040 --> 35:17.280
does anyone still have objections?

35:20.960 --> 35:21.920
I have an objection!

35:37.640 --> 35:39.400
Miss Ji, you have arrived just in time.

35:39.480 --> 35:42.320
Let's see how it compares

35:42.400 --> 35:43.880
to your father's Shu Red Silk.

35:49.600 --> 35:50.560
Yingying,

35:51.640 --> 35:52.720
Niu Jin's power is immense.

35:53.840 --> 35:55.240
Even if you're sharp,

35:55.920 --> 35:57.920
you can't shake him.

35:59.120 --> 36:00.040
Think carefully.

36:23.320 --> 36:24.600
This silk's color is wrong.

36:29.360 --> 36:32.520
True Shu Red Silk
remains unchanged in alkaline water.

36:33.240 --> 36:35.400
But this silk has already faded.

36:36.280 --> 36:38.720
Everyone, you can carefully inspect
the red silk in your hands.

36:38.800 --> 36:41.000
If the red used to be perfect,

36:41.080 --> 36:42.680
now it's only at 70%.

36:44.160 --> 36:45.920
Only 70%…

36:54.200 --> 36:55.800
Can everyone see the difference now?

37:12.520 --> 37:13.560
Xiuyuan,

37:16.720 --> 37:19.680
the Shu Red Silk you worked so hard to dye

37:19.760 --> 37:22.800
is now being
publicly questioned by Miss Ji.

37:22.880 --> 37:24.520
You're not going to say anything?

37:40.760 --> 37:41.920
As we all know,

37:42.920 --> 37:43.960
Shu Red Silk

37:44.720 --> 37:46.400
was created by Miss Ji's father.

37:48.640 --> 37:50.600
The silk created by her own father

37:51.240 --> 37:52.400
was lost for many years,

37:53.360 --> 37:54.280
but now someone else has dyed it.

37:56.680 --> 37:58.280
She finds it hard to accept,

37:58.880 --> 38:00.040
which is understandable.

38:24.880 --> 38:26.040
Brocade has elegance,

38:26.920 --> 38:28.600
and people should have character too.

38:46.160 --> 38:47.600
Today, I won't believe

38:48.320 --> 38:51.720
that only I can recognize
the fading of this silk.

38:52.760 --> 38:53.760
Everyone here

38:54.760 --> 38:56.560
is in the brocade business,

38:56.640 --> 38:58.440
and your ability to distinguish colors
is exceptional.

38:59.280 --> 39:00.680
Today, the truth of right and wrong

39:00.760 --> 39:02.760
rests with all of you.

39:04.320 --> 39:06.000
I humbly ask you

39:06.080 --> 39:08.560
to carefully examine
the silk in your hands.

39:08.640 --> 39:11.760
See if it really is unchanged.

39:12.720 --> 39:15.120
Everyone, this matter concerns
the art of Shu brocade.

39:15.200 --> 39:17.440
If this centuries-old art of Shu brocade
is judged by only one person's word,

39:17.520 --> 39:19.440
it may never have made it to today!

39:19.520 --> 39:21.280
Please, think this over.

39:21.360 --> 39:23.240
I ask you all to speak honestly!

39:32.520 --> 39:33.560
General Niu,

39:36.480 --> 39:40.680
I may not be able
to distinguish the fading or not,

39:41.440 --> 39:43.280
but I've personally touched

39:43.360 --> 39:45.400
the Shu Red Silk dyed by the Ji family.

39:45.480 --> 39:47.880
The texture is indeed different.

40:03.440 --> 40:05.320
- Oh…
- Sit down!

40:05.400 --> 40:06.240
Yes.

40:27.000 --> 40:27.960
Mr. Yang,

40:28.720 --> 40:30.080
your sense of touch

40:30.160 --> 40:32.840
is just like Miss Ji's eyes,

40:32.920 --> 40:34.600
both from an individual perspective.

40:35.600 --> 40:36.880
Think carefully before you answer.

40:55.480 --> 40:56.680
Miss Ji,

41:00.000 --> 41:02.800
you just want to clarify everything
in front of everyone, right?

41:02.880 --> 41:04.000
Fine.

41:04.080 --> 41:05.720
I'll ask for you.

41:15.320 --> 41:16.360
Mrs. Yang,

41:17.320 --> 41:18.920
is this indeed Shu Red Silk?

41:30.600 --> 41:31.880
As for me,

41:31.960 --> 41:33.280
I only know business,

41:33.800 --> 41:34.720
not brocade weaving.

41:35.840 --> 41:39.440
So,
I can't tell the difference in the silk.

41:45.440 --> 41:46.840
Mr. Sun,

41:46.920 --> 41:49.200
is this the real Shu Red Silk?

41:49.280 --> 41:51.640
Absolutely. Without a doubt.

41:51.720 --> 41:52.960
Mr. Wang?

41:53.840 --> 41:54.840
It's absolutely authentic.

41:54.920 --> 41:58.200
It is truly Shu Red Silk.

42:09.440 --> 42:11.160
What do you all think?

42:11.920 --> 42:14.320
It is indeed Shu Red Silk!

42:24.280 --> 42:26.120
Turning lies into truth

42:26.200 --> 42:27.600
and reversing right and wrong.

42:28.320 --> 42:30.920
Yingying, have you seen clearly now?

42:31.520 --> 42:34.240
This is power.

42:38.960 --> 42:40.040
Miss Ji,

42:41.400 --> 42:42.960
since everyone else believes it,

42:43.760 --> 42:44.840
why deceive yourself?

42:49.840 --> 42:51.600
The underdog can't take down the powerful.
